#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kpresenter; is the presentations program in the &koffice; productivity "
"suite. Using &kpresenter;, you can prepare a set of slides for use in an on-"
"screen slideshow or for printing. Your slides can include text and graphics "
"in a variety of formats, and of course, you can embed all sorts of objects "
"using KParts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &koffice; productivity suite consists of a number of applications which "
"are designed to work together. Overview documentation for &koffice; is "
"available, as well as manuals for each component of the suite. The "
"components of &koffice; are:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kword; - a frames based wordprocessor."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kspread; - a spreadsheet application."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kpresenter; - a presentations application."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kformula; - an editor for mathematical formulae."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kchart; - an application to draw charts and diagrams."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&koffice; is a free (or open-source) software project which is released "
"under the terms of the &GNU; General Public License."
msgstr ""

